---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const breadcrumbJsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    {
      '@type': 'ListItem',
      position: 1,
      name: 'Home',
      item: 'https://strovagroups.in/',
    },
    {
      '@type': 'ListItem',
      position: 2,
      name: 'Terms of Service',
      item: 'https://strovagroups.in/terms/',
    },
  ],
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service & IP Protection — Strova Group"
  description="Commercial terms, IP ownership, anti-scraping protections, and delivery policies for Strova Group."
  jsonLd={[breadcrumbJsonLd]}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Legal &amp; Commercial</span>
      <h1>Terms of Service &amp; IP Protection</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Last updated: October 12, 2026</p>

      <div class="card card--quiet" style="padding: var(--space-6); margin-block: var(--space-6); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);">
        <p class="text-xs text-muted" style="margin: 0;">
          <strong>Legal Notice:</strong> Strova Group is a proprietorship of Babita Kumari (Udyam: UDYAM-JH-20-0147452). These terms govern website usage, copyright protection, and commercial client engagements. Formal service agreements with clients are executed via written Statements of Work (SOW).
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Intellectual Property &amp; Protection Against Copying</h2>
      <p>
        All content published on this website—including but not limited to written copy, design systems, illustrations, branding elements, software code snippets, and structural layout—is the exclusive intellectual property of <strong>Strova Group</strong> and protected under Indian and international copyright and intellectual property laws.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Strict Prohibition on Scraping and Reproduction:</strong> You may not copy, reproduce, mirror, crawl, scrape, decompile, or redistribute any part of this website's text, visual design, or source code for commercial or competing purposes without prior written authorization from Strova Group.
      </p>
      <p>
        <em>Proprietary synthesis of the Strova Group intellectual framework remains strictly non-reproducible without prior notarized authorization.</em>
      </p>

      <h2>2. Reporting Copyright Misuse or Copying</h2>
      <p>
        If you identify unauthorized copying, digital reproduction, or infringement of Strova Group's materials across any platform, please report it immediately to our operations desk:
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="mailto:info@strovagroups.in?subject=Report%20Copyright%20Misuse" class="btn btn--outline btn--sm">
          Report misuse or copying to info@strovagroups.in &rarr;
        </a>
      </p>

      <h2>3. Commercial Client Engagements &amp; The 50% Advance Model</h2>
      <p>
        For technical engineering, mobile app development, WhatsApp automation, and growth marketing services:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Written Scope:</strong> Every engagement requires an explicit, itemized written technical specification or Statement of Work signed by both parties before development commences.</li>
        <li><strong>50% Commitment Advance:</strong> A fifty percent (50%) upfront deposit is required to schedule engineering sprints and allocate resources.</li>
        <li><strong>50% Final Settlement:</strong> The remaining fifty percent (50%) is invoiced only after staging demonstration, quality review, and prior to production domain cutover.</li>
        <li><strong>100% Code &amp; IP Transfer:</strong> Upon final milestone settlement, complete unencumbered ownership of custom code, repositories, and documentation is transferred to the client.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. 30-Day Post-Launch Bug Warranty</h2>
      <p>
        Delivered custom software systems include a complimentary 30-day bug warranty effective from the production deployment date. Strova Group promptly resolves any reproducible functional defects that diverge from the agreed specification at zero extra cost.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Limitation of Liability &amp; Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        In no event shall Strova Group be liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from website usage or service delivery. Total aggregate liability for commercial engagements is capped at the fees paid under the relevant statement of work in the three months preceding the claim.
      </p>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of India. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts of India.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        Official contact desk for Strova Group:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Entity:</strong> Strova Group (Proprietorship of Babita Kumari)</li>
        <li><strong>Udyam Registration:</strong> UDYAM-JH-20-0147452</li>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@strovagroups.in">info@strovagroups.in</a></li>
        <li><strong>Phone &amp; WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="tel:+919288077802">+91 92880 77802</a></li>
        <li><strong>Hours:</strong> Monday – Saturday, 10:00 AM – 7:00 PM IST</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
